<h3>Who Can Apply?</h3>
<p>Master's Degree with 55% marks (50% for reserved). Final year students can also apply. No age limit for Assistant Professor.</p>

<h3>Fees</h3>
<p>General: Rs.1150 | OBC/EWS: Rs.600 | SC/ST/PwD: Rs.325</p>

